OL,3,GNEWSAFriends cycle 1,000 miles in
OL,4,Abuilder's memory
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Dick Cashmore lost his life in
OL,7,F2020 following a long mental health
OL,8,Fbattle, his friends wanted to make sure
OL,9,Fother men in the construction industry
OL,10,Fdid not suffer in silence.
OL,12,FIn his memory, the group of six from
OL,13,FBromsgrove, Worcestershire, completed a
OL,14,Fgruelling 1,000-mile bike ride in 11
OL,15,Fdays from John O'Groats in Scotland to
OL,16,FLand's End in Cornwall.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
