OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1790409340
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAFriends cycle 1,000 miles in
OL,4,Abuilder's memory
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis family and friends have also
OL,7,Festablished the Dick Cashmore Legacy
OL,8,FFoundation, which aims to raise
OL,9,Fawareness of mental health in
OL,10,Fconstruction and funds for the charity
OL,11,FMind.
OL,13,FThe six riders, "Stem, Moggy, Connor,
OL,14,FPete, Si and Frank", initially set
OL,15,Fthemselves a fundraising target of
OL,16,F#16,000, but have since raised more
OL,17,Fthan #20,000.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
